  "role_pinned": {
   "text": "\"<<My Song>>  \nI woke up in the middle of the night,  \nWith a heart that was beating too fast.  \nThe silence was heavy, the shadows were long,  \nAnd I felt like I was losing my ground.  \n\nI tried to speak, but my words would not come,  \nThey were stuck in the throat like a stone.  \nI looked in the mirror, and I saw a ghost,  \nA reflection of a life I could not hold.  \n\nI walked through the streets, alone and afraid,  \nEach step felt like a fall from the floor.  \nThe world was a maze, and I was lost,  \nIn a dream that I couldn't control.  \n\nBut I kept going, even when the pain was too much,  \nFor the truth was that I had to keep going.  \nEven when the world felt like it was breaking,  \nI found strength in the silence, the breaking of the glass.  \n\nSo I sing my song, with a heart that's still beating,  \nA story of struggle and a journey that's not ending.  \nI'm not perfect, I'm not without flaws,  \nBut I'm here, and I'm fighting for my truths.  \n\nThis is my song, a tale of the night,  \nOf the battles I've fought and the dreams I've tried to reach.  \nI'll keep singing, even when the world is against me,  \nFor I am the voice that will never be silenced.\"",
